Course Type Extractor API: 

A FastAPI-based microservice that extracts course/degree types (like B.Sc, MBA, PhD, Diploma, etc.) from input text using regular expressions (Regex).

Features: 

 Detects Undergraduate, Postgraduate, Doctoral, and Diploma course names

 Handles multiple aliases (e.g., B.Sc, BS, Bachelor of Science)

 Accepts both single JSON and list of JSON objects as input

 Returns detected course types in a clean JSON response

 Lightweight & easy to extend

Installation: 

 git clone https://github.com/ISudhan/resume-parsing.git

 cd course-type

 pip install uvicorn 

 pip install fastapi 

 uvicorn api:app --reload

Example Request & Response: 

Input (Single JSON)

{
  "text": "I have completed my B.Sc in Computer Science and MBA in Finance."
}

Output

{
  "received_data": ["B.Sc", "MBA"]
}
